<title>JAPAN: BOJ&quot;s Matsushita to appear at parliament panel.</title>
<headline>BOJ&quot;s Matsushita to appear at parliament panel.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Japan (BOJ) Governor Yasuo Matsushita will appear before the budget panel of parliament&quot;s Lower House from 10 a.m. (0100 GMT) on Wednesday, the BOJ said in a statement.</p>
<p>The statement said he would answer questions but did not elaborate on the topic.</p>
